 "title": "Episode 36",
 "duration": 658,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 13.46,
   "end": 16.0,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Android 19 says \"Ow\" repeatedly as Goku pummels him"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 20.32,
   "end": 22.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Are you afraid...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 23.78,
   "end": 29.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "It's okay, you know... to feel that creeping, seizing fear..."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 29.06,
   "end": 32.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Not everyone faces their deaths so openly..."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 34.12,
   "end": 40.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "I'll admit, your composure is admirable, even in the face of your inevitable demise..."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 40.92,
   "end": 43.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Death's gaze squarely on you..."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 43.52,
   "end": 46.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "You still keep calm, cool..."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 46.44,
   "end": 49.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "...and oh, for God's sakes, Nineteen!"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 49.42,
   "end": 51.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "THROW A F*CKING PUNCH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 73.06,
   "end": 75.06,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Goku v. Android 19 goes on as before..."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 75.06,
   "end": 77.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Mr. Piccolo! What have we missed?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 77.22,
   "end": 82.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Well, your father is currently handing the Pillsbury Dough-Bot its generous white ass."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 82.14,
   "end": 87.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Yes, well, your feeble understanding of our abilities would lead you to believe such."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 87.4,
   "end": 91.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "But Nineteen has yet to truly demonstrate his full killing proficiency."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 92.06,
   "end": 94.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen! Attack from the left!"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 94.12,
   "end": 94.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Higher."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 95.0,
   "end": 95.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Ouch."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 95.6,
   "end": 97.3,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Battle resumes as before"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 95.6,
   "end": 97.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "No! My left!"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 97.3,
   "end": 99.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "As I was saying..."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 99.1,
   "end": 103.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen is merely lulling your comrade into a false sense of security..."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 103.92,
   "end": 104.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "And once we--"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 104.94,
   "end": 106.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen, dodge!"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 106.56,
   "end": 108.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Beginning dodge protocol-- ouch."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 108.44,
   "end": 109.44,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "And again..."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 108.44,
   "end": 112.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Why is dodging a subroutine?! It's not that complex!"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 113.56,
   "end": 116.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "What?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 116.3,
   "end": 117.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Regardless..."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 117.38,
   "end": 122.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Once we've secured our vantage point, Android 19 will move in for the kill."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 122.48,
   "end": 126.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "And your precious Son Goku will feel the full sting of my vengeance!"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 126.98,
   "end": 127.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Ow..."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 129.38,
   "end": 130.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Hm..."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 130.74,
   "end": 131.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "A moment."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 131.84,
   "end": 134.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen, would you stop messing around?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 135.32,
   "end": 137.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ka...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 137.04,
   "end": 138.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Me...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 138.76,
   "end": 140.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Oh, that's distressing."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 140.94,
   "end": 143.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen, respond! Immediately!"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 143.62,
   "end": 145.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ha...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 145.36,
   "end": 147.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Me...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 147.1,
   "end": 149.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen, what are you, in safe mode?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 149.76,
   "end": 155.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Start responding this instant, before I shove my boot Up! Your! Arse!"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 155.42,
   "end": 156.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Reboot completed."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 156.36,
   "end": 158.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "HAAAA!"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 159.52,
   "end": 161.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "\"Murder.exe\" fully online."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 161.72,
   "end": 162.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 162.82,
   "end": 163.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Bully."
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 163.66,
   "end": 165.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Huh... didn't seem to work..."
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 166.24,
   "end": 168.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Don't worry guys, I'll try again."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 168.24,
   "end": 169.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Double strength!"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 169.3,
   "end": 170.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ka...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 170.5,
   "end": 171.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Me...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 171.48,
   "end": 174.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Goku, don't! They can absorb your energy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 174.52,
   "end": 175.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Hold on a sec."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 176.04,
   "end": 177.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Did you know?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 177.24,
   "end": 180.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Well, yeah, I felt it when the old man was holding me earlier..."
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 180.68,
   "end": 184.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "And you couldn't have said anything before because...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 184.2,
   "end": 190.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Hey, gimme a break. I've already been through enough crap today... and if I wanted to be bitched at, I would've stayed with Bulma and the baby."
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 190.36,
   "end": 194.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Yeah guys, lay off him. He needs this like he needs a hole in the chest."
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 195.0,
   "end": 197.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Ehhh?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 197.0,
   "end": 197.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I get it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 197.84,
   "end": 199.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "And he's got you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 199.42,
   "end": 201.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh hey... can I have that energy back--"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 201.7,
   "end": 202.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Huah! Huah!"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 202.8,
   "end": 203.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Dad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 203.5,
   "end": 204.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ahh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 205.56,
   "end": 207.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Guys... I don't want to make a scene..."
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 208.0,
   "end": 209.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "But I'm pretty sure I'm dying..."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 209.7,
   "end": 212.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "What's going on?! He hasn't used that much energy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 212.9,
   "end": 214.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Krillin! A Senzu Bean!"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 214.9,
   "end": 215.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "SENZU BEAN!"
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 216.64,
   "end": 217.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Thanks, buddy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 218.8,
   "end": 221.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "*Oh, God, it made it worse...*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 221.64,
   "end": 223.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Goku! What's wrong?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 223.34,
   "end": 225.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Chest hurts... hard to breathe..."
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 225.86,
   "end": 226.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "How's your arm?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 226.82,
   "end": 228.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Dunno... can't feel it..."
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 229.54,
   "end": 230.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Is that normal...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 230.82,
   "end": 232.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "So, Goku's having a heart attack."
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 232.58,
   "end": 235.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Dad! You took the medicine, right?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 235.5,
   "end": 237.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Yeah...! Well, I mean..."
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 237.78,
   "end": 239.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I started to..."
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 239.32,
   "end": 240.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Started to--"
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 240.54,
   "end": 241.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "...What?"
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 241.34,
   "end": 242.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "You mean you *stopped*?"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 243.06,
   "end": 244.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Why did you *stop*?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 244.58,
   "end": 247.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Because it was *grape*-flavor-herd...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 248.26,
   "end": 248.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Fahh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 253.74,
   "end": 256.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Did he just knock the Super Saiyan out of him...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 256.46,
   "end": 258.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Piccolo! Tag in!"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 258.16,
   "end": 259.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Huuaarr-- AGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 261.14,
   "end": 262.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Gohan! Tag in!"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 262.94,
   "end": 263.52,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Squish"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 262.94,
   "end": 263.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Agh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 263.52,
   "end": 266.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "(Continues to groan in pain)"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 266.74,
   "end": 269.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Well boys, I can't say it hasn't been fun."
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 269.86,
   "end": 275.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "In fact, if I still had a penis, it would be quite auspicious that we are wearing baggy pants."
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 275.98,
   "end": 278.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "But enough about hypothetical erections..."
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 278.8,
   "end": 282.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen! Suck! Him! Dry!"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 282.64,
   "end": 283.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Ha ha!"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 283.6,
   "end": 285.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "No! Dad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 285.5,
   "end": 294.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Mine mine mine...! (Repeats ad nauseam)"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 289.32,
   "end": 290.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Does anyone else hear that?"
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 290.74,
   "end": 292.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Yeah, and it's getting closer..."
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 292.48,
   "end": 294.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "And it sounds an awful lot like..."
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 294.92,
   "end": 295.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Ouch."
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 296.72,
   "end": 297.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "...Mine."
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 298.98,
   "end": 301.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "And the Prodigal Asshole returns!"
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 301.46,
   "end": 302.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Mr. Piccolo!"
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 302.64,
   "end": 306.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "I *wanted* to wait for an opening on the Android, so I faked my injury."
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 306.64,
   "end": 308.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "But now he's here."
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 308.22,
   "end": 310.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Wait, so you weren't actually wounded?"
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 310.64,
   "end": 312.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "No, but I got a better question:"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 312.64,
   "end": 314.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Where was *my* Senzu Bean?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 314.34,
   "end": 315.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "SENZU BEAN!"
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 318.52,
   "end": 320.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey, Vegeta..."
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 320.18,
   "end": 322.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Kakarot, you idiot. What are you doing?"
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 322.46,
   "end": 324.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Dying... mostly..."
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 325.18,
   "end": 325.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Little help...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 325.98,
   "end": 326.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 326.56,
   "end": 328.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Thanks, best buddy...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 328.04,
   "end": 328.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Ugh."
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 328.9,
   "end": 332.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Come on, Dad. We'll get you home, and give you the medicine."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 332.22,
   "end": 333.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "No, let me do it."
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 333.9,
   "end": 336.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Let's be honest - if I stay, I'll probably just get in the way."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 336.86,
   "end": 337.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Yep."
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 337.36,
   "end": 337.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Probably."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 337.96,
   "end": 338.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "No offense."
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 338.5,
   "end": 339.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Why are you even here?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 341.58,
   "end": 342.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "SENZU BEAN!"
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 345.2,
   "end": 346.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "...You know what? Have fun."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 348.02,
   "end": 352.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Primary threat escaping... two kilometers... three kilometers..."
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 352.18,
   "end": 355.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Excuse me, but your primary threat is right here."
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 356.42,
   "end": 358.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "...Six kilometers... seven kilometers..."
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 358.78,
   "end": 360.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Am I being ignored?"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 360.16,
   "end": 364.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Don't mind him, he's programmed to only respond to my command."
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 364.48,
   "end": 369.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen, forget about Son Goku; we can finish him at our leisure."
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 369.66,
   "end": 371.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "For now, focus on..."
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 372.1,
   "end": 373.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Who are you again?"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 373.8,
   "end": 374.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Scanning..."
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 375.44,
   "end": 377.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Vegeta. Prince of all Saiyans."
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 377.6,
   "end": 380.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Oh, of course. How could I forget?"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 380.34,
   "end": 382.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Nineteen, take care of him."
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 382.34,
   "end": 383.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Understood."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 383.22,
   "end": 385.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Oh-ho-ho! This is precious!"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 385.52,
   "end": 388.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You expect to beat me with this automa-ton of fun?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 388.72,
   "end": 389.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Registering insult."
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 390.6,
   "end": 393.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Retort: You are short and your hairline is receding."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 393.48,
   "end": 395.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ooh-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo! Scathing."
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 395.4,
   "end": 398.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Your confidence is noted, Vegeta."
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 398.24,
   "end": 405.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "But Son Goku was able to achieve a form far beyond anything we'd ever seen before... and we still beat him!"
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 405.32,
   "end": 409.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "And, Nineteen has extensive knowledge of all your techniques."
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 409.64,
   "end": 410.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Oh, is that right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 410.94,
   "end": 413.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Quite the cutting-edge piece of tech you've got there."
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 413.6,
   "end": 415.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "But I'm curious..."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 415.32,
   "end": 416.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Can it feel fear?"
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 416.9,
   "end": 417.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Scanning..."
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 418.14,
   "end": 418.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Processing..."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 420.16,
   "end": 421.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Results inconclusive."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 421.82,
   "end": 423.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Let's fix that, shall we?"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 423.62,
   "end": 430.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Haaaaaaauuuuuuuuuuuuuhhh...!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 430.54,
   "end": 434.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "SERIOUSLY! WHAT THE F*CK IS *NAMEK*?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 434.0,
   "end": 437.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "HEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA...!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 437.2,
   "end": 442.56,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ Rock music ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 445.3,
   "end": 446.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "But how?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 446.38,
   "end": 450.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "I thought you had to have a pure heart to become a Super Saiyan! Like my Dad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 450.46,
   "end": 454.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Oh trust me, there's more than one way to realize the legend."
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 455.04,
   "end": 460.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I wanna! I wanna be a Super Saiyan! I wanna! I wanna! I wanna! I wanna! I wanna I wanna!"
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 461.22,
   "end": 464.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Push-ups, sit-ups, and plenty of juice."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 464.5,
   "end": 467.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "And besides, my heart is pure..."
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 467.58,
   "end": 471.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Pure... unadulterated... badass."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 471.58,
   "end": 474.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Yeah, more like pure unadulterated ego."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 474.6,
   "end": 476.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I heard that, Triclops!"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 476.36,
   "end": 477.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Is that okay?"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 477.64,
   "end": 479.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "As a matter of fact, go f*ck yourself!"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 479.78,
   "end": 480.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Now where was I--"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 483.64,
   "end": 485.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hm... what a shame..."
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 487.24,
   "end": 490.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Looks like you just initiated your self-destruct sequence."
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 490.62,
   "end": 492.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Let me give you a countdown."
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 492.26,
   "end": 492.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Five!"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 493.04,
   "end": 493.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Ouch."
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 493.78,
   "end": 494.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Ow. Ow."
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 495.58,
   "end": 497.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "'Did I just see his *foot*?!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 498.28,
   "end": 500.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Well, well, well. Looks like I'm a size 19."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 501.38,
   "end": 501.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Four!"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 503.46,
   "end": 504.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Ahhh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 505.6,
   "end": 507.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "So, have you rusted your pants yet?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 508.88,
   "end": 509.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Three!"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 513.96,
   "end": 514.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "'Damn it!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 514.88,
   "end": 516.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "'No... don't panic.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 516.88,
   "end": 523.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "'Everything will turn out dandy as long as Android 19 can grab Vegeta and steal his energy.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 524.22,
   "end": 530.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You know, I'm sure there was an advantage to building a fat robot, but for the life of me, I just don't see it."
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 531.32,
   "end": 532.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Proximity breached."
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 532.78,
   "end": 534.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "\"Trap.exe\" activated."
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 534.78,
   "end": 539.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Yes! That's it, Nineteen! Do not let go of him, no matter what!"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 539.66,
   "end": 543.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 20",
   "text": "Drain him until he's a shriveled up prune of a corpse!"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 543.42,
   "end": 544.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Parameters recognized."
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 545.34,
   "end": 546.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Grip locked."
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 546.28,
   "end": 546.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "\"Locked\", huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 547.28,
   "end": 549.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Well, guess I'm not going anywhere for a while..."
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "start": 550.0,
   "end": 550.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hurrh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "start": 551.24,
   "end": 553.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "How's about I get a workout in?"
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "start": 555.78,
   "end": 559.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "That's right - I'm gonna do squats all over your *face*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "start": 559.98,
   "end": 562.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Initiating... energy... drain..."
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "start": 562.78,
   "end": 564.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Aw, how adorable."
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "start": 564.84,
   "end": 566.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "So you want my energy then?"
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "start": 566.66,
   "end": 569.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Tell you what - take as much as you want!"
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "start": 569.74,
   "end": 572.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "In exchange, I'll take your hands!"
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "start": 572.76,
   "end": 573.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Two!"
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "start": 576.72,
   "end": 579.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Error...! Error...! Error...! Error! Error!"
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "start": 580.78,
   "end": 584.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "So then, before I put down the clown, let's put it to bed, shall we?"
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "start": 585.6,
   "end": 587.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Do you feel fear, Android?"
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "start": 587.66,
   "end": 588.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "No, please!"
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "start": 588.94,
   "end": 589.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Get away!"
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "start": 589.88,
   "end": 590.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Leave me alone!"
  },
  {
   "i": 215,
   "start": 591.44,
   "end": 593.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "All I needed to hear."
  },
  {
   "i": 216,
   "start": 593.06,
   "end": 596.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "No no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no no!"
  },
  {
   "i": 217,
   "start": 598.06,
   "end": 599.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "*One*."
  },
  {
   "i": 218,
   "start": 599.26,
   "end": 600.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "BIG BANG ATTACK!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 219,
   "start": 603.32,
   "end": 604.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "No no no no no no no!"
  },
  {
   "i": 220,
   "start": 604.68,
   "end": 606.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "No...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 221,
   "start": 621.88,
   "end": 624.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Your 30-day trial has expired."
  },
  {
   "i": 222,
   "start": 624.26,
   "end": 629.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 19",
   "text": "Would you like to... purchase... Win... RAR...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 223,
   "start": 631.3,
   "end": 632.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "SENZU BEAN!"
  },
  {
   "i": 224,
   "start": 636.18,
   "end": 641.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ah, now that we have Chuckles the Assclown out of the picture, how about we tend to the elderly--"
  },
  {
   "i": 225,
   "start": 649.22,
   "end": 650.92,
